From: Rasheed <arasheedu@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 14:53:48 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 03/10] server: trace chat and generate requests

Read X-Trace-Request-Id, X-Trace-Detail and X-Trace-Step, attach a tracer
to the request context and emit request.received, model.load start/done,
decode.token for the text each response chunk sends to the client
(thinking + content, after parsers), stream.chunk at full detail and
request.done/request.error. Allow the X-Trace-* headers through CORS and
expose X-Trace-Request-Id.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
